    "https://recrutement.psl.eu/si8p1dx133": {
      "title": "Preclinical Assistant Engineer or Study Engineer (F/M)",
      "description": "Preclinical Assistant Engineer or Study Engineer (F/M) | PSL Paramètres d’accessibilité fermer Contrastes Défaut Renforcer Inverser Police (dyslexie) Défaut Adapter Interlignage Défaut Augmenter Justification Défaut Supprimer Aller au contenu principal fr ▼ fr en Menu RH Découvrir PSL Nos établissements La recherche à PSL La formation à PSL L’innovation à PSL Nos engagements La qualité au cœur de la stratégie RH Favoriser le développement des compétences Une université inclusive et sans discrimination Une université responsable et ouverte Index égalité professionnelle Formation Centre d'Innovation Pédagogique Ecole Interne Toutes nos offres Recrutement Primary tabs Voir Generate PDF Preclinical Assistant Engineer  or Study Engineer (F/M) (F/H) Localisation du poste 91400, Orsay, France Télécharger en pdf Partager : Facebook Linked in Imprimer Postuler Environnement et contexte de travail Notre établissement fait partie de l'Université PSL. Située au cœur de Paris, celle-ci fait dialoguer tous les domaines du savoir, de l'innovation et de la création. Classée parmi les 50 premières universités mondiales, elle forme au plus près de la recherche des chercheurs, artistes, ingénieurs, entrepreneurs ou dirigeants conscients de leur responsabilité sociale, individuelle et collective. Structure d'accueil Institut Curie is a major player in cancer research and the fight against the disease. It’s made up of a hospital and a research center with a staff of over 1000 and a strong international presence. The goal of the Institut Curie Research Center is to advance basic research and apply the resulting knowledge to improve cancer diagnosis, prognosis, and treatment, within the continuum linking basic research to innovation for the benefit of patients. Missions Activités principales Laboratory - Service The Preclinical Investigation Laboratory (LIP) has more than 20 years of experience working with PDX models and is actively involved in molecular and experimental pharmacology. The LIP creates a space where clinicians can collaborate with biologists working on basic research questions and pharmaceutical partners. The LIP is affiliated with the Translational Research Department and the platform is also a member of the EuroPDX European consortium which aims to share patient derived xenografts for collaborative research projects and multicentre preclinical trials. The selected candidate will be in charge of in vivo experiments. https://institut-curie.org/plateforme/curiecoretech-laboratory-preclinical-investigation Missions -        Participate in pharmacology experiments: carry out grafts, treatments, animal monitoring, organ collection, freezing, saving and archiving data from experiments and formatting of data from experiments for presentation -        Application of regulations related to the use of animals for scientific purposes -        Participation in communal lab tasks Profil du candidat Savoirs et compétences attendus Training and experience -        Bac+3 to Bac+5 -        Specific animal experimentation training (level 1 Project Designer or 2 Practitioner) Required skills and qualities -        You’re dynamic and wish to participate in in vivo LIP experiments -        You have a strong sense of teamwork, organizational skills, and attention to detail. -        You are proficient in scientific and office software tools. -        English is an asset, but not required All our opportunities are open to people with disabilities. Contract information Contract type : CDD Start date : as soon as possible Contract duration : 6 months renewable Work time : Full time Salary : from  27504€ to   29240€ /year according to current salary scales Advantages : Restauration collective, prise en charge du titre de transport annuel à 70%, mutuelle d’entreprise Location : Orsay Contact Please send your CV and cover letter Publication date: 06/10/2026 Deadline for application: Once filled Faithful to the legacy of its founder, the Institut Curie is deeply committed to promoting equal opportunities, diversity, and inclusion. Convinced that diversity of backgrounds and experiences contributes to collective performance, we strive to provide everyone with a respectful and equitable working environment and encourage all candidates to apply for our job opportunities. https://euraxess.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/brochures/eur_21620_en-fr.pdf Compétences linguistiques Anglais, Niveau conversationnel Diplôme et expérience professionnelle Bac+3, Bac+4, Bac+5 Non discrimination, ouverture et transparence Notre établissement, comme l'ensemble de l'Université PSL, s’engage à soutenir et promouvoir l’égalité, la diversité et l’inclusion au sein de ses communautés. Nous encourageons les candidatures issues de profils variés, que nous veillerons à sélectionner via un processus de recrutement ouvert et transparent. Contact si8p1dx1335k@emploi.beetween.com Autres informations Rémunération De 27504.0 à 29240.0 € (Euros) par an Type de contrat / de poste CDD Durée du contrat 6 mois Quotité de travail Référence si8p1dx133 Publié le 06/10/2026 Postuler Preclinical Assistant Engineer  or Study Engineer (F/M) (F/H) Localisation du poste 91400, Orsay, France Établissement Institut Curie Environnement et contexte de travail Notre établissement fait partie de l'Université PSL. Située au cœur de Paris, celle-ci fait dialoguer tous les domaines du savoir, de l'innovation et de la création. Classée parmi les 50 premières universités mondiales, elle forme au plus près de la recherche des chercheurs, artistes, ingénieurs, entrepreneurs ou dirigeants conscients de leur responsabilité sociale, individuelle et collective. Structure d'accueil Institut Curie is a major player in cancer research and the fight against the disease. It’s made up of a hospital and a research center with a staff of over 1000 and a strong international presence. The goal of the Institut Curie Research Center is to advance basic research and apply the resulting knowledge to improve cancer diagnosis, prognosis, and treatment, within the continuum linking basic research to innovation for the benefit of patients. Missions Activités principales Laboratory - Service The Preclinical Investigation Laboratory (LIP) has more than 20 years of experience working with PDX models and is actively involved in molecular and experimental pharmacology. The LIP creates a space where clinicians can collaborate with biologists working on basic research questions and pharmaceutical partners. The LIP is affiliated with the Translational Research Department and the platform is also a member of the EuroPDX European consortium which aims to share patient derived xenografts for collaborative research projects and multicentre preclinical trials. The selected candidate will be in charge of in vivo experiments. https://institut-curie.org/plateforme/curiecoretech-laboratory-preclinical-investigation Missions -        Participate in pharmacology experiments: carry out grafts, treatments, animal monitoring, organ collection, freezing, saving and archiving data from experiments and formatting of data from experiments for presentation -        Application of regulations related to the use of animals for scientific purposes -        Participation in communal lab tasks Profil du candidat Savoirs et compétences attendus Training and experience -        Bac+3 to Bac+5 -        Specific animal experimentation training (level 1 Project Designer or 2 Practitioner) Required skills and qualities -        You’re dynamic and wish to participate in in vivo LIP experiments -        You have a strong sense of teamwork, organizational skills, and attention to detail. -        You are proficient in scientific and office software tools. -        English is an asset, but not required All our opportunities are open to people with disabilities. Contract information Contract type : CDD Start date : as soon as possible Contract duration : 6 months renewable Work tim